    {"type": "header", "page_idx": 0, "bbox": [40, 110, 560, 135], "text": "Abstract", "text_level": 1},
    {"type": "text", "page_idx": 0, "bbox": [40, 140, 560, 185], "text": "This deterministic fixture checks equations, citations, and a persistent outline without any network request."},
    {"type": "header", "page_idx": 0, "bbox": [40, 200, 560, 225], "text": "1 Introduction", "text_level": 1},
    {"type": "text", "page_idx": 0, "bbox": [40, 230, 560, 275], "text": "The reader should expose a stable hierarchy while preserving long English paragraphs and citation markers [1]."},
    {"type": "header", "page_idx": 0, "bbox": [40, 290, 560, 315], "text": "2 Background", "text_level": 1},
    {"type": "text", "page_idx": 0, "bbox": [40, 320, 560, 365], "text": "A normalized score uses the inline factor $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{d_k}}$ before comparing two vectors."},
    {"type": "header", "page_idx": 0, "bbox": [40, 380, 560, 405], "text": "3 Model Architecture", "text_level": 1},
    {"type": "header", "page_idx": 0, "bbox": [55, 415, 560, 440], "text": "3.2 Attention", "text_level": 2},
    {"type": "header", "page_idx": 0, "bbox": [70, 450, 560, 475], "text": "3.2.1 Scaled Dot-Product Attention", "text_level": 3},
    {"type": "text", "page_idx": 0, "bbox": [70, 480, 560, 525], "text": "The attention operator maps queries and keys to weights, then combines the values in document order."},
    {"type": "text", "page_idx": 0, "bbox": [70, 530, 560, 575], "text": "$$\\operatorname{Attention}(Q,K,V)=\\operatorname{softmax}(QK^T/\\sqrt{d_k})V$$"},
    {"type": "header", "page_idx": 0, "bbox": [40, 590, 560, 615], "text": "References", "text_level": 1},
    {"type": "text", "page_idx": 0, "bbox": [40, 620, 560, 650], "text": "[1] Example A. Deterministic document rendering. 2026."}
  ],
